{"_id":"wmCraftEdge00001","name":"Crafting Edge","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","description":"<p>On any critical success, roll d3. Use Final Block (d4) when accelerated work could finish the contribution. Result 4 is final-block only: if 100% work is insufficient, use Accelerated Work instead; otherwise roll the Masterstroke table.</p><p>Manual table rolls show results in chat. The Workbench already resolves these rolls automatically; do not apply a manual result a second time.</p>","formula":"1d3","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"craftingTable":"wmCraftEdge00001"}},"results":[{"_id":"wmCraftEdge00001","type":"text","name":"Accelerated Work","description":"<p><strong>Accelerated Work</strong></p><p>Generate 150% of committed days as work, rounded up. No additional effect.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[1,1],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmCraftEdge00002","type":"text","name":"Material Conservation","description":"<p><strong>Material Conservation</strong></p><p>Generate 100% work. Preserve workshop consumables worth up to 10% of one selected Resource Unit used by this contribution. This credit cannot be sold or converted into fractional Resource Units.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[2,2],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmCraftEdge00003","type":"text","name":"Stable Integration","description":"<p><strong>Stable Integration</strong></p><p>Generate 150% work, rounded up. Gain a +2 circumstance bonus to the next Work Block for this contribution.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[3,3],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmCraftEdge00004","type":"text","name":"Masterstroke Opportunity","description":"<p><strong>Masterstroke Opportunity</strong></p><p>Generate 100% work. If this completes the contribution, roll a Masterstroke; otherwise, use Accelerated Work.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[4,4],"drawn":false}]}
{"_id":"wmMasterstroke01","name":"Masterstroke","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","description":"<p>Roll after Masterstroke Opportunity completes the contribution at 100% work. Hidden Detail is allowed for all crafted equipment. Masterstrokes do not use Artisan Mark capacity.</p><p>Manual rolls show the effect in chat; they do not attach it to an item. Workbench crafting records its automatically rolled Masterstroke on the finished item.</p>","formula":"1d8","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"craftingTable":"wmMasterstroke01"}},"results":[{"_id":"wmMasterstrok001","type":"text","name":"Maker’s Signature","description":"<p><strong>Maker’s Signature</strong></p><p>A harmless visual, audible, or tactile maker motif appears when the item is readied or activated. While its provenance remains intact, the item can be authenticated as that artisan’s work.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[1,1],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok002","type":"text","name":"Resilient Finish","description":"<p><strong>Resilient Finish</strong></p><p>Gain a +2 circumstance bonus to the first future Repair check made on this item, then expend this benefit.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[2,2],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok003","type":"text","name":"Opened Channel","description":"<p><strong>Opened Channel</strong></p><p>Gain a +2 circumstance bonus to the first Work Block check of this item’s next upgrade project, then expend this benefit.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[3,3],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok004","type":"text","name":"Efficient Maintenance","description":"<p><strong>Efficient Maintenance</strong></p><p>The first future repair or maintenance contribution requires 1 fewer artisan-day, to a minimum of 1, then expend this benefit.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[4,4],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok005","type":"text","name":"Hidden Detail","description":"<p><strong>Hidden Detail</strong></p><p>The item can conceal one object of negligible Bulk. Finding it requires a Search or Perception check against the item’s current Crafting DC.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[5,5],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok006","type":"text","name":"Balanced Carry","description":"<p><strong>Balanced Carry</strong></p><p>While carried or stowed, the item counts as one Bulk step lighter, to a minimum of negligible. This does not alter wielding, usage, armor category, damage, value, or recipe requirements.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[6,6],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok007","type":"text","name":"Resonant Tell","description":"<p><strong>Resonant Tell</strong></p><p>The current bearer receives a harmless sensory warning when the item becomes damaged, one of its Marks becomes Dormant, or its tracked charges are exhausted.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[7,7],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok008","type":"text","name":"Storied Presence","description":"<p><strong>Storied Presence</strong></p><p>Gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Make an Impression or Request when this item’s documented maker or provenance is directly relevant. This does not stack with another circumstance bonus.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[8,8],"drawn":false}]}
